    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a professional LinkedIn post about {{$json.topic}} for {{$json.audience}}.\n\nOBJECTIVE:\n\n* Educate developers\n* Improve readability\n* Build professional authority\n* Make the post easy to skim on LinkedIn\n\nIMPORTANT FORMAT RULES:\n\n* Do NOT use markdown\n* Do NOT use LaTeX\n* Do NOT use symbols like $O(n)$\n* Write complexities as plain text:\n  Example:\n  O(n)\n  O(n^2)\n\nPOST STRUCTURE:\n\n1. Strong hook\n2. Short explanation\n3. Key learning points using bullets\n4. Real-world applications\n5. Personal reflection\n6. Closing question\n\nRULES:\n\n* Leave a blank line between paragraphs\n* Keep paragraphs maximum 2 lines\n* Use clean spacing\n* Avoid giant paragraphs\n* Keep tone professional and human-written\n* Return ONLY the final LinkedIn post\n\n",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "id": "19319159-c55d-4c70-94b3-9d8792f6309f",
      "name": "LINKEDIN POST GENERATOR"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return items.map(item => {\n\n  let raw = item.json.text;\n\n  raw = raw\n    .replace(/\\\\n/g, '\\n')\n    .replace(/\\*\\*/g, '')\n    .replace(/\\$/g, '')\n    .replace(/#{1,6}\\s/g, '')\n    .replace(/\\r/g, '')\n    .trim();\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      content: raw\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ],
      "id": "b2e48876-ff99-41d3-8ec9-13df745b2f37",
      "name": "FORMAT CONTENT"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate 10 professional LinkedIn hashtags based ONLY on the LinkedIn post below.\n\nRULES:\n\n* Relevant to software engineering\n* Relevant to DSA\n* Relevant to developer growth\n* Avoid spammy hashtags\n* Avoid generic hashtags\n* Return hashtags in one line\n* No numbering\n* No explanations\n\nLinkedIn Post:\n{{$json.content}}\n\n",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1024,
        0
      ],
